@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
title Registro de visita: persistência, Observer e AOP
actor "Usuário" as U
participant "Spring MVC" as MVC
participant "Proxy AOP" as AOP
participant "VisitController" as VC
participant "OwnerRepository" as Repo
database "H2 (via JPA)" as DB
participant "ApplicationEventPublisher" as Pub
participant "LembreteVisitaListener" as Listener
U -> MVC : POST /owners/{ownerId}/pets/{petId}/visits/new
MVC -> AOP : processNewVisitForm(...)
AOP -> VC : proceed()
VC -> VC : validar Visit
alt dados válidos
  VC -> VC : owner.addVisit(petId, visit)
  VC -> Repo : save(owner)
  Repo -> DB : persistir (JPA/Hibernate)
  DB --> Repo : confirmação
  Repo --> VC : retorna
  VC -> Pub : publishEvent(VisitaRegistradaEvent)
  Pub ->> Listener : @EventListener + @Async
  activate Listener
  VC --> AOP : redirect:/owners/{ownerId}
  AOP -> AOP : log [AUDITORIA]
  AOP --> MVC : 302
  MVC --> U : HTTP 302
  ... em outra thread ...
  Listener -> Listener : sleep(2 s) simula lembrete
  note right of Listener: Sem envio real de SMS/e-mail
  deactivate Listener
else inválidos
  VC --> AOP : retorna formulário com erros
  AOP --> MVC : retorna view
  MVC --> U : HTTP 200, formulário
end
@enduml
